* FastHenry output for magic cell wire

.Units um
.Default rho=0.02 nhinc=3 nwinc=3 rh=2 rw=2

* Reference plane (substrate, ground)
Gsub x1=-0.80 y1=-0.80 z1=0 x2=40.80 y2=-0.80 z2=0
+ x3=40.80 y3=2.40 z3=0
+ thick=0.1 seg1=20 seg2=4
+ Ngp (-0.80,-0.80,0)

Nsub x=-0.80 y=-0.80 z=0
.Equiv Nsub Ngp

.freq fmin=1e+09 fmax=1e+09

* Order of arguments to SPICE subcircuit call:
* 1 in
* 2 out
* 3 GND!

.end
